docs {
  # Onboarding (sandbox)

  Getting a participant onto the NHCX sandbox: one call to create it and one to update it, no passcode. The registry id is your ABDM client id.

  Production onboarding is the folder beside this one, Onboarding (production): the v2 calls, each confirmed with a passcode sent to the registered mobile.
}
